# CodeAlpha Internship - Task 2: SEO & Keyword Research

## Project Overview
This repository contains the submission for Task 2, focusing on SEO and Keyword Research tailored for **CodeAlpha**. The goal is to identify high-volume, trending keywords related to internships, coding, and training programs to boost blog and post visibility.

## Target Keywords (15-20 Suggestions)

| Keyword | Search Volume | Primary Intent |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Web Development Internship | High | Commercial / Investigation |
| Online Coding Training Programs | High | Informational / Educational |
| Best Remote Tech Internships | High | Job Seekers |
| Software Engineering Internship 2026 | High | Timely Trend |
| Python Programming for Beginners | Very High | Educational |
| CodeAlpha Internship Review | Medium | Branded / Trust Building |
| Frontend Developer Internship | High | Practical Learning |
| How to get a tech internship | High | Content Marketing Blog |

## Strategy for CodeAlpha Blogs
1. **Long-tail Keywords:** Use phrases like "How to get a tech internship with CodeAlpha" to capture high-intent users.
2. **On-Page SEO:** Include these keywords in the Title, H1/H2 tags, and Meta Descriptions of CodeAlpha's blog posts.
3. **Social Media:** Use short-form variations of these keywords as hashtags on LinkedIn and Instagram posts.
